  "solution": {
    "text": "Only symmetrical alkanes are prepared using wurtz reaction.<br />So only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi></mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>CH</mi><munder><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>|</mo></munder></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>CH</mi><munder><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>|</mo></munder></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;can be prepared using this reaction."
